## Virus Test

### Memory Test

| ACA  |  Macumba 3.3 |  Merlin's Mad | Non-Executable EICAR Virus  | Oli  |  EICAR+ |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
|  Sagrotan said that there is a high probability that the virus is in the memory. Sargotan said that three vectors are infected. |   |  Sagrotan said that there is a high probability that the virus is in the memory. Sagrotan said that two vectors are infected. |  Sagrotan said that no exception vectors are outside the allowed memory area |  Sagrotan said that there is a high probability that the virus is in the memory. Sagrotan said that four vectors are infected.  |  Sagrotan said there is a high probability that the virus is in the memory. Sagrotan said that one vector is infected. |

### Bootsector Test

|  ACA |  Macumba 3.3 | Merlin's Mad  |  Non-Executable EICAR Virus | Oli  |
|---|---|---|---|---|
|  Sagrotan detected 6 signs of virus infection, found that the checksum is $1234, and requested to clean the disk from viruses |  Sagrotan found that the checksum is $1234, said it is an MS-DOS disk, and added that virus infection is unlikely | Sagrotan detected 3 signs of virus infection, found that the checksum is $1234, and requested to clean the disk from viruses  | Sagrotan said the disk is not executable  | Sagrotan correctly identified the OLI virus  |

## In conclusion

An excellent virus killer capable of detecting new viruses. 5,5/10